WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.409
Thirty-four hundred hours of speech, and every hour deserved to arrive in text exactly as it left the speaker.

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:16.680
You did that work here, and you caught the machine doing something else in its place.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:21.641
Name the discipline, one word, and the wing is mine again.
